{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In &quot;Looks About Right,&quot; players step into the shoes of an upcoming forger in a thrilling art simulation game. Your mission is to replicate famous artworks and currency and legal documents with incredible precision. Will you become the ultimate counterfeiter, or will your art fall flat? Get ready to test your skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254470/extras/Demo_Snippet.gif?t=1744161178\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you are up for a real test of skill you can try out our Challenge Mode which you need to score 100%</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254470/extras/2025-04-0712-08-32-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1744161178\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you wanna see how good your art would do in this world head over to our sandbox mode where you can draw your own art and sell it for money in an auction full of rich people\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254470/extras/0407-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1744161178\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3254470?t=1744161178","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254470/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744161178","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254470/80ee5163d5cb43829148a84aff852862b2f951f0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744161178","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254470/80ee5163d5cb43829148a84aff852862b2f951f0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744161178","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":